# 📰 NewsHub - Online News Website

NewsHub is a modern and responsive online news website created using HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

The website provides a simple interface for reading different categories of news such as India, Technology, Education, Sports, Business and Science.

---

## 🌐 Live Website

After enabling GitHub Pages, your website can be opened using your GitHub Pages URL.

Example:

https://YOUR-USERNAME.github.io/Online-News-Website/

---

## ✨ Features

- 🏠 Modern Home Page
- 📰 Latest News Section
- 🇮🇳 India News
- 💻 Technology News
- 🎓 Education News
- 🏆 Sports News
- 💼 Business News
- 🔬 Science News
- 🔍 News Search
- 🌙 Dark Mode
- 📱 Responsive Design
- 📖 Read More News Popup
- 📧 Contact Form
- ℹ️ About Us Page
- 📱 Mobile Friendly Navigation

